    "detailed_description": "Turbo Sliders Unlimited is a spiritual successor to many classic top-down racing games, but in 3D and with modern online features and extensive customization and modding possibilities. It goes far beyond being just a racing game \u2014 it is a community-driven platform where anyone can create their own levels, vehicles, and game modes. It can be played as a serious esports game, as a fun casual game, or as a sandbox game. It can be played alone or as a multiplayer game, both locally and online.<br><br>The game has a massive number of game modes and tuning possibilities, with new ones still possibly coming. Different game modes include various forms of racing, sumo, tag, soccer, capture-the-flag, collector, and weapon battle. Join the TSU Discord Server to stay up to date with the latest news, share your ideas and feedback, and connect with the developers and other players!<br><br>Main features:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online multiplayer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Supports up to 20 players, plus spectators<br></li><li>Anyone can host their own public or private games with custom levels, vehicles and settings<br></li><li>All game modes supported online: racing, sumo, collector, tag, soccer, CtF, battle and their countless variations<br></li><li>Dedicated server support with server-side scripting<br></li><li>Based on authoritative server and client side prediction \u2014 perfect for esports!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Single-player game modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Time Trials campaign: Race against clock or leaderboard ghosts to unlock new events<br></li><li>Race Challenges campaign: Race against AI players in special race events<br></li><li>Player made campaigns: Play campaigns made by other players, or create and share your own<br></li><li>Quick Game: Compete in multi-event racing sessions against AI players<br></li><li>Local custom game: Customize a game session to your liking \u2014 adjust levels, vehicles, event settings, AI etc.<br></li><li>Hotlapping: Beat leaderboard lap times, optionally racing against ghost recordings of other players</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Local multiplayer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Couch gaming with up to 4 local players in split-screen<br></li><li>Possible to join or host online multiplayer games together, too</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level and vehicle creation and sharing</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Feature-rich in-game level and vehicle editors included<br></li><li>Sharing via Steam Workshop or by automatic downloading in online games</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AI Editor</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create and optionally share your own AI lines to new tracks and/or vehicles<br></li><li>Create and customize your own AI player groups</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Camera</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple camera presets, all of which can be extensively tuned <br></li><li>Camera modes include 3rd person (close or far), 1st person, top-down, fixed position, free camera</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recording games</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Any game can be recorded and viewed later, with options to change camera angles and playback speeds</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Vehicle looks can be customized by changing color, paint jobs and paint properties (metallicness, smoothness)<br></li><li>It is possible to buy customization packs unlocking new colors, paint textures, more paint commands per a paint job, and more range for paint properties</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Special game modes</h2>In addition to standard racing and its variations, the game also supports various other game modes, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Parkour / platforming / obstacle course<br></li><li>Ghost race<br></li><li>Car sumo<br></li><li>Capture the Flag<br></li><li>Base infiltration<br></li><li>Battle with weapons (team vs team or free-for-all)<br></li><li>Tag game (spread or transfer tag)<br></li><li>Car soccer with 1 or up to 5 balls<br></li><li>Car &quot;soccer&quot; without balls (score by driving to goal)<br></li><li>Collector (shared or exclusive coins to collect)<br></li><li>Race with deadly terrain or contacts<br></li><li>Race with drafting on (tunable strength)<br></li><li>Race with weapons enabled<br></li><li>Race with fuel (refueling possible in the pit)<br></li><li>Race with tire wear (changing tires possible in the pit)<br></li><li>Team games - all game modes have team game support<br></li><li>More might be coming - suggest your own ideas on the TSU Discord Server</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Turbo Sliders Unlimited is a spiritual successor to many classic top-down racing games, but in 3D and with modern online features and extensive customization and modding possibilities. It goes far beyond being just a racing game \u2014 it is a community-driven platform where anyone can create their own levels, vehicles, and game modes. It can be played as a serious esports game, as a fun casual game, or as a sandbox game. It can be played alone or as a multiplayer game, both locally and online.<br><br>The game has a massive number of game modes and tuning possibilities, with new ones still possibly coming. Different game modes include various forms of racing, sumo, tag, soccer, capture-the-flag, collector, and weapon battle. Join the TSU Discord Server to stay up to date with the latest news, share your ideas and feedback, and connect with the developers and other players!<br><br>Main features:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online multiplayer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Supports up to 20 players, plus spectators<br></li><li>Anyone can host their own public or private games with custom levels, vehicles and settings<br></li><li>All game modes supported online: racing, sumo, collector, tag, soccer, CtF, battle and their countless variations<br></li><li>Dedicated server support with server-side scripting<br></li><li>Based on authoritative server and client side prediction \u2014 perfect for esports!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Single-player game modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Time Trials campaign: Race against clock or leaderboard ghosts to unlock new events<br></li><li>Race Challenges campaign: Race against AI players in special race events<br></li><li>Player made campaigns: Play campaigns made by other players, or create and share your own<br></li><li>Quick Game: Compete in multi-event racing sessions against AI players<br></li><li>Local custom game: Customize a game session to your liking \u2014 adjust levels, vehicles, event settings, AI etc.<br></li><li>Hotlapping: Beat leaderboard lap times, optionally racing against ghost recordings of other players</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Local multiplayer</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Couch gaming with up to 4 local players in split-screen<br></li><li>Possible to join or host online multiplayer games together, too</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level and vehicle creation and sharing</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Feature-rich in-game level and vehicle editors included<br></li><li>Sharing via Steam Workshop or by automatic downloading in online games</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AI Editor</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create and optionally share your own AI lines to new tracks and/or vehicles<br></li><li>Create and customize your own AI player groups</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Camera</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple camera presets, all of which can be extensively tuned <br></li><li>Camera modes include 3rd person (close or far), 1st person, top-down, fixed position, free camera</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recording games</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Any game can be recorded and viewed later, with options to change camera angles and playback speeds</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Vehicle looks can be customized by changing color, paint jobs and paint properties (metallicness, smoothness)<br></li><li>It is possible to buy customization packs unlocking new colors, paint textures, more paint commands per a paint job, and more range for paint properties</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Special game modes</h2>In addition to standard racing and its variations, the game also supports various other game modes, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Parkour / platforming / obstacle course<br></li><li>Ghost race<br></li><li>Car sumo<br></li><li>Capture the Flag<br></li><li>Base infiltration<br></li><li>Battle with weapons (team vs team or free-for-all)<br></li><li>Tag game (spread or transfer tag)<br></li><li>Car soccer with 1 or up to 5 balls<br></li><li>Car &quot;soccer&quot; without balls (score by driving to goal)<br></li><li>Collector (shared or exclusive coins to collect)<br></li><li>Race with deadly terrain or contacts<br></li><li>Race with drafting on (tunable strength)<br></li><li>Race with weapons enabled<br></li><li>Race with fuel (refueling possible in the pit)<br></li><li>Race with tire wear (changing tires possible in the pit)<br></li><li>Team games - all game modes have team game support<br></li><li>More might be coming - suggest your own ideas on the TSU Discord Server</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Driving game with Unlimited possibilities. Spiritual successor to classic top-down racing games, but in 3D with modern online features, countless game modes and extensive moddability. For casual fun, serious competition, or to unleash your creativity with the editors.",
